notes.body:
@johnthacker I've implemented your idea and works as expected. I also did some renaming.

I made a function for the three type of BA that uses a bitmap. I wasn't fan of the embedded ternaries to handle the 4-bytes multi-STA BA bitmap so I handled it on its own.

I've tested the code on a 64bits compressed BA, the 256bits compressed BA (from #20156) and multi-STA 64bits BA. I have no capture of DMG traffic so I don't have anything to test the extended compressed BA.

